# Islands

- Default output is HTML/CSS. Put `client:*` components in `src/components/islands/`.
- Weakest directive that works. No `client:load` for below-fold UI.
- No barrel imports. No client fetch for LCP content.
- Fonts local after lock. Images reserve dimensions.
